---
title: "How should Highlights open on a page?"
accTitle: "Highlights page-open attempt chain"
accDescr: "Try the documented highlights page URL first; if that launch fails, fall back to today's file open and say so in the toast."
config:
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 14
    nodeSpacing: 16
    wrappingWidth: 260
---
flowchart TD
  URL["`**Page URL**<br/>highlights:// path #page`"]
  Q{{"`**Did open succeed?**`"}}
  FILE["`**File-open fallback**<br/>bundle plus PDF path`"]
  TOASTP["`**Toast names the page**`"]
  TOASTF["`**Toast: last page**`"]
  URL ==> Q
  Q -->|Yes| TOASTP
  Q -->|No| FILE
  FILE --> TOASTF
  classDef decision fill:#FFF7E6,stroke:#C77C02,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#4A3000
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  classDef muted fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6B7280,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1F2937
  classDef focus fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3B78C2,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0F2E52
  class URL focus
  class Q decision
  class TOASTP outcome
  class FILE,TOASTF muted
